Third-party components
----------------------

The Windows 12 theme (`web/src/themes/windows/`) is a 1:1 visual clone of the
unofficial concept project "win12" by win12-online
(https://github.com/win12-online/win12), licensed under the Eclipse Public
License 2.0 (EPL-2.0). That license is reproduced verbatim in
`THIRD_PARTY/win12-online/LICENSE.epl2`, and the trademark notice of the
original project is kept at `THIRD_PARTY/win12-online/icon-NOTICE.md` and
`web/public/icons/win12/NOTICE.md`.

All other code in this repository is original work licensed under the MIT
license above.
